            "review_text": "soetkinc87\nHanoi, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nThe best vegetarian food in Hanoi!\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe accidentally saw this place. It is a cosy, beautiful restaurant on the second floor but you pay the same amount as you pay on the street for street food. The food was really delicious and well presented. There is a lot of choice. From breakfast to maindishes, appitisers, hot pot, soups and desserts. All vegetarian and really original. Just go there! You won't regret it!!\nRead more\nWritten December 3, 2019",
